Base chance:

| Material Rarity | Drop Chance |
| --------------- | ----------: |
| Common          |         60% |
| Uncommon        |         25% |
| Rare            |         10% |
| Epic            |          4% |
| Legendary       |          1% |

Nilai tersebut merupakan base RNG dan dapat dimodifikasi oleh:

```text
Exploration Level
Location
Difficulty
Hero Skill
Luck
Party Composition
Equipment
Exploration Quest
World Event
RNG Modifier
```

